s8ref.let format? gain?
#-----------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJECTS WITH HIGH AMPLITUDE TREMOR:
# REST TREMOR, CONDITION: DBS ON, MEDICATION OFF (n=5 files)
#-----------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJ   FILE      RANGE VELOCITY LASER  RATE SAMPLES
# g1     g1ref.let 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6690
# g2     g2ref.rit 0.2   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6336
# v3     
# v4     
# v5     
# s6     s6ref.let 0.2   mm/s     0-0.2  100  7260
# s7     s7ref.rit 0.5   mm/s     0-0.2  100  6402
# s8     s8ref.let 0.2   mm/s     0-0.2  100  7896
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# SUBJ:  g = GPi = Globus Pallidus interna
#        v = Vim = Ventro-intermediate nucleus of the thalamus
#        s = STN = subthalamic nucleus
# RANGE:    Range (V)  Precision (+/- mm/s)
#               2.0        1.0 
#               1.0        0.5
#               0.5        0.25
#               0.2        0.1
#               0.1        0.05
# VELOCITY: units of velocity in recordings 
#           (mm/s or m/s)
# LASER: laser speed setting 
#        (0-0.2 m/s or 0-1 m/s)
# RATE: sampling rate in Hz
# 
# SAMPLES: number of samples in recording
#----------------------------------------------------------------------------
